1
00:00:00,907 --> 00:00:03,377
(Howard:)We were 15... I just said,
"Don't say it."

2
00:00:03,376 --> 00:00:05,146
(Emily:)No, it's okay.

3
00:00:05,145 --> 00:00:06,975
(Emily:)He told me that story
a long time ago.

4
00:00:06,980 --> 00:00:08,080
Raj!

5
00:00:08,081 --> 00:00:09,251
(Raj:)It was our first date,

6
00:00:09,249 --> 00:00:10,419
(Raj:)there was an
awkward silence.

7
00:00:10,416 --> 00:00:12,946
(Howard:)What was I
supposed to say?

8
00:00:17,123 --> 00:00:18,823
(gasps)

9
00:00:18,825 --> 00:00:20,895
(Penny:)Oh, it's beautiful.

10
00:00:20,894 --> 00:00:23,164
(Leonard:)Oh, the girls really
did a nice job.

11
00:00:23,163 --> 00:00:24,333
(Howard:)Aw...

12
00:00:24,330 --> 00:00:25,900
(Penny:)I know I wasn't
into this before,

13
00:00:25,899 --> 00:00:28,299
(Penny:)but I'm so glad I get
to take you to your first prom.

14
00:00:28,301 --> 00:00:30,271
(Leonard:)What makes you think
I didn't go to my prom?

15
00:00:30,270 --> 00:00:32,400
(Sheldon:)I went.
Well, who'd you go with?

16
00:00:32,405 --> 00:00:36,275
(Leonard:)I took a little lady
I like to call loneliness.

17
00:00:36,276 --> 00:00:37,406
(Howard:)Aw...

18
00:00:37,410 --> 00:00:38,940
Aw, it's all right.

19
00:00:38,945 --> 00:00:40,145
(Leonard:)We ended up having a threesome

20
00:00:40,146 --> 00:00:41,846
(Leonard:)with her friend humiliation,
so...

21
00:00:44,417 --> 00:00:46,747
(Penny:)Well, if I would have been
there and saw you alone,

22
00:00:46,753 --> 00:00:48,023
(Penny:)I would've asked you
to dance.

23
00:00:48,021 --> 00:00:48,951
(Leonard:)No, you wouldn't have.

24
00:00:48,955 --> 00:00:50,155
(Penny:)Well, you don't
know that.

25
00:00:50,156 --> 00:00:51,686
(Leonard:)It was before
my growth spurt.

26
00:00:51,691 --> 00:00:52,861
(Penny:)What, that already happened?

27
00:00:52,859 --> 00:00:54,859
(imitates laughter)

28
00:00:54,861 --> 00:00:56,831
(Leonard:)Very funny.

29
00:00:56,830 --> 00:00:58,300
(Penny:)Well, you wouldn't
have asked me either.

30
00:00:58,298 --> 00:00:59,528
(Leonard:)I would have asked you.

31
00:00:59,532 --> 00:01:00,432
(scoffs)

